msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nellie alone enjoyed her time dancing with her brother—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫and quite thoroughly, "
"at that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Нелли одна наслаждалась танцем со своим братом — ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫и не без причины."

#: scenario:scenario_328DB8FA_B8B2_403D_B8D5_D807A430EC74
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 162020dc29e88ba60572f29f7398026db793a0b6d4b3ad72d391eb936037513f
